5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I’m worried the budget vanishes into hidden costs. I want to see where the money actually goes.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,We keep planning for staff who aren’t here. I need to know who is actually doing the work.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,The shows we loved on paper didn’t bring people back. I want to check the visitor records.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,The building has limits. I need to know what the floor and rigging can actually handle.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,We always get caught out by delivery delays. I want to see where past seasons failed.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Victoria, that’s a real fear. If the staff is stretched, the costs will spike too.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, exactly. If we don’t know who’s working, we can’t plan the budget or the schedule.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, structural limits are hard facts. I’ll focus on what visitors actually remember.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, memory is nice, but a collapsed bay is not. I’ll check the physical constraints.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Shion, I agree. Let’s look at the paperwork and the transport costs to see the real friction.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
