16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I’ll check the conservation lab staffing and the volunteer roster composition.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,I’ll review the weekend head counts and the visitor comment slips.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I’ll examine the structural survey of the suspended bay and the maintenance log.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I’ll look at the lender paperwork and the evening hire bookings.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,I’m ready to see where the money is hiding.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I hope the staff data is clear.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
