35,2,1,talk,Mio,,"@Victoria, my data shows transport and mounts eat a third of the budget. It’s scary.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, that’s high. My staffing data is worse. The lab is down to one person.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shion,,"@Mio, costs are one thing. My head counts show people only return if something moves.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, movement is dangerous. My survey says the bay can’t hold heavy stonework.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"@Asuka, I agree. My paperwork check shows two recent openings slipped due to late docs.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Shizue, late docs mean late payments. That’s why the budget feels like it’s leaking.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, if the lab is backed up, we can’t even clean the objects we have.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Victoria, a clean object in an empty room is still an empty room. I need presence.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, presence is fine, but if the rigging fails, there’s no room at all.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Asuka, the evening hires also damage open displays. We need something secure.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Shion, if we pick something with local craftspeople, the transport costs drop to zero.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, that’s smart. Local means no shipping, and the volunteers can help with the demos.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Victoria, local craftspeople are exactly the ""presence"" my comment slips mention.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, local textiles are light. They won’t break the bay’s weight limit.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Asuka, and no distant lenders means no paperwork delays. It’s the safest path.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,I’m leaning towards the local textiles. It saves money and uses our people.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Victoria,,I agree. The volunteer roster is full of town history folks who can guide the demos.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shion,,"The data supports it. People come back for the people, not just the objects.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Asuka,,It fits the structural limits. No heavy rigging needed.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shizue,,It avoids the delivery traps. I’m comfortable with this choice.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
